              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "version": 1,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "If you want your content to start showing up cited in AI answers instead of just search results, let's talk about how to structure it.",
                    "type": "text",
                    "version": 1
                  }
                ],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            ],
            "direction": "ltr"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "6a544f9c140e75434aba4df5",
        "blockName": null,
        "columns": [
          {
            "id": "6a544f9c140e75434aba4df1",
            "size": "full",
            "enableLink": null,
            "richText": {
              "root": {
                "type": "root",
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "version": 1,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tag": "h3",
                    "type": "heading",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "What's included",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Structuring content so AI answer engines can extract and cite specific passages, not just index the page as a whole.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Implementation and maintenance of a machine-readable content manifest (`llms.txt`/`llms-full.txt`): a file that explicitly describes what the site contains, in a format AI agents can consume directly.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Structured data and semantic markup that reinforce content understanding for both traditional search engines and generative AI systems.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "This very site already implements this infrastructure: check /llms.txt and /llms-full.txt for a real, working example, not a promise.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  }
                ],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            },
            "link": {
              "type": "reference",
              "newTab": null,
              "url": null,
              "label": null,
              "appearance": "default"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "6a544f9c140e75434aba4df2",
            "size": "full",
            "enableLink": null,
            "richText": {
              "root": {
                "type": "root",
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "version": 1,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tag": "h3",
                    "type": "heading",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "How I work",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "I start by auditing how citable your content is today: whether it's structured into clear, self-contained passages, or depends on context scattered across the page that an AI system can't reconstruct.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "I implement and maintain the `llms.txt`/`llms-full.txt` manifest, updating it as the site adds new content. It's not a file generated once and forgotten.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "I review existing semantic markup and structured data, tuning it to give content a better shot at getting cited, not just indexed.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  }
                ],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            },
            "link": {
              "type": "reference",
              "newTab": null,
              "url": null,
